@startuml
autonumber

participant "Root caller" as Caller
participant "Root IRS" as Root
participant "Root EDC" as RootEdc
participant "Child EDC" as ChildEdc
participant "Child IRS" as Child
participant "Digital Twin Registry" as DTR
participant "Submodel provider" as Submodel

Caller -> Root: POST /irs/recursive/jobs
Root -> Root: validate request and chain opening grant
Root --> Caller: 201 Created (jobId)
Root -> Root: process root job asynchronously
Root -> DTR: lookup shell by globalAssetId
DTR --> Root: shell descriptor
Root -> RootEdc: request SingleLevelBomAsPlanned submodel
RootEdc -> Submodel: EDC data transfer
Submodel --> RootEdc: BOM payload
RootEdc --> Root: BOM children
Root -> Root: filter direct children by grant

Root -> RootEdc: send recursive REQUEST notification
RootEdc -> ChildEdc: EDC transfer
ChildEdc -> Child: POST /irs/recursive/notifications

Child -> Child: validate header, payload and chain opening grant
Child --> ChildEdc: notification accepted
Child -> Child: process child job asynchronously
Child -> DTR: lookup shell and submodel descriptors
DTR --> Child: shell descriptor
Child -> ChildEdc: request BOM submodel
ChildEdc -> Submodel: EDC data transfer
Submodel --> ChildEdc: BOM payload
ChildEdc --> Child: BOM children
Child -> ChildEdc: request anonymized PURIS submodels
ChildEdc -> Submodel: EDC data transfer
Submodel --> ChildEdc: anonymized payloads
ChildEdc --> Child: local items

alt granted child branches exist
    Child -> ChildEdc: send recursive REQUEST notifications
    Child -> Child: wait for child responses or timeout
else leaf branch
    Child -> Child: no child requests
end

Child -> Child: aggregate childItems, items and tombstones

Child -> ChildEdc: send recursive RESPONSE notification
ChildEdc -> RootEdc: EDC transfer
RootEdc -> Root: POST /irs/recursive/notifications
Root -> Root: correlate response and aggregate result
Caller -> Root: GET /irs/recursive/jobs/{jobId}
Root --> Caller: job envelope and recursive result

@enduml
